                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 892.001/65.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the American Minister
                        to Siam.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-10-25"><hi rendition="#italic">October 25,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Letter accrediting you as President’s special representative at coronation mailed
                    to-day.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adee.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
